    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal Night Shift</strong> is an observation and spot the anomaly game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner, Gary, are ghost hunters. A desperate call from a family in distress leads you to a house in a residential area of North London, where strange phenomena are disrupting their daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to keep a close eye on the cameras and report any anomalies to your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, this house is truly haunted and if you miss too many anomalies, you might not survive the night...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have three nights to play, 3 to 5 hours of gameplay, depending on your powers of observation, and a mystery to unfold gradually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes peeled, ghost hunter, and good luck!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Paranormal Night Shift</strong> is an observation and spot the anomaly game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner, Gary, are ghost hunters. A desperate call from a family in distress leads you to a house in a residential area of North London, where strange phenomena are disrupting their daily lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job is to keep a close eye on the cameras and report any anomalies to your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, this house is truly haunted and if you miss too many anomalies, you might not survive the night...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have three nights to play, 3 to 5 hours of gameplay, depending on your powers of observation, and a mystery to unfold gradually.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes peeled, ghost hunter, and good luck!</p>",
